    },
    "Keep Touch Controls Hidden" : {

    },
    "Keeping the session awake nudges the cursor by a pixel after two idle minutes so GeForce NOW does not disconnect you mid-cutscene; a dot in the corner shows while it is doing that. The HUD sits over the game, so keep it to the numbers you actually watch. Values in the normal range stay untinted on purpose — amber and red are what should catch your eye." : {

